WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
Luke steps toward Ryu after the prerequisite corner throw.

2
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.050
Ryu reaches for a throw while Luke backs out of range.

3
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.800
Standing heavy punch punishes Ryu’s throw recovery.

4
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.750
Perfect medium Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

5
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:03.550
Jumping medium punch catches Ryu in the air.

6
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:04.250
The delayed short-held air light Knuckle continues the juggle.

7
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:06.250
Light Rising Uppercut finishes the corner punish.
